    "title": "Fans react to Iowa basketball March Madness win vs. Clemson",
    "text": "MEN'S BASKETBALLFans react to Iowa basketball March Madness win vs. ClemsonZach HineyHawkeyes WireMarch 20, 2026, 8:40 p.m. CTKeep WatchingFor the first time in five years, the Iowa men's basketball team has won an NCAA Tournament game.The Hawkeyes led for the majority of the night in their 67-61 win over Clemson in Tampa. It was an extremely impressive performance from the supporting cast, who stepped up big on an off-night for superstar point guard Bennett Stirtz. Kael Combs led the way with 15 points, including a huge layup with a minute to play. Alvaro Folgueiras was excellent as well, finishing the night with 14 points.Iowa advances to the second round of the NCAA Tournament and awaits a date with the winner of top-seeded Florida and No. 16 seed Prairie View A&M. After the first tournament win in years for the Hawkeyes, fans and media members alike were quick to heap praise on the entire team.Social media reacts to Iowa basketball's March Madness win over ClemsonContact/Follow us @HawkeyesWire on X (formerly Twitter) and like our page on Facebook to follow ongoing coverage of Iowa news, notes and opinions. Follow Zach on X: @zach_hineyNeed a news break? Check out the all new PLAY hub with puzzles, games and more!60+ Women Are Emptying Their Supplement Cabinets For This DrinkGundry MD | SponsoredSponsoredLearn MoreUndoCostco Shoppers Say This Antiwrinkle Item Is \"Actually Worth It\"Olavita | SponsoredSponsoredUndoYour Refund is Calling! IRS E-File is OpenTurboTax | SponsoredSponsoredLearn MoreUndoBrain Fog Has Been Linked to This Common Daily Food. Did You Eat It?Memory Loss | SponsoredSponsoredRead MoreUndoby Taboolaby TaboolaYou might be interested in the content above- | SponsoredSponsoredUndoOn this island, none of this treasure is buriedAtlantis Paradise Island | SponsoredSponsoredBook NowUndo48-Year-Old CEO Puts $2.6B on One StockThe Motley Fool | SponsoredSponsoredUndoIf You Avoid Sleeveless Tops - Watch ThisWG Skin Daily | SponsoredSponsore